            'What is one plan you have for this week?',
            'Which meal do you look forward to?',
            'What song has been stuck with you lately?',
            'Do you follow cricket, another sport, or neither?',
            'Which film would you tell a friend to watch?',
            'What is a city in India you would visit again?',
            'Train, bus, or flight for a long trip?',
            'What does a good Sunday look like for you?',
            'Are you a morning person?',
            'What is a hobby you picked up in the last year?',
            'What is a hobby you dropped?',
            'Coffee, chai, or something cold?',
            'Sweet or spicy?',
            'What street food do you trust?',
            'Is there a festival you still enjoy?',
            'What is a family story that gets repeated?',
            'Which language do you dream in, if you notice?',
            'What is a word you like from your own language?',
            'Do you read, or do you prefer audio?',
            'What did you study, and do you still use it?',
            'What is a skill you wish were taught in school?',
            'Where do you get your news, if you follow it?',
            'What is a view you changed?',
            'What is an ordinary thing you enjoy?',
            'Hill station or coast?',
