            'What is the best window seat you remember?',
            'Do you like a plan, or do you decide on the day?',
            'What is a local market you like?',
            'What music fits a rainy evening?',
            'Live concert or a quiet room?',
            'Which actor do you watch for the film, not the fame?',
            'A film that was better the second time?',
            'Do you play any game, on a phone or outside?',
            'What did your neighbourhood sound like growing up?',
            'Is there a teacher you still remember?',
            'What is a small kindness from a stranger?',
            'What do you cook well, if you cook?',
            'What do you order when you cannot decide?',
            'Early sleeper or late sleeper?',
            'What is on your desk or table right now?',
            'A podcast, a playlist, or silence while you travel?',
